        "@language": "it",
        "@value": "Questa proprietà collega un'Organizzazione al suo identificatore EDMO (European Directory of Marine Organisations)."
      },
      {
        "@language": "el",
        "@value": "Αυτή η ιδιότητα συνδέει έναν Οργανισμό με το αναγνωριστικό EDMO (European Directory of Marine Organisations)."
      },
      {
        "@language": "es",
        "@value": "Esta propiedad vincula una Organización con su identificador EDMO (European Directory of Marine Organisations)."
      },
      {
        "@language": "no",
        "@value": "Denne egenskapen kobler en organisasjon til dens EDMO-identifikator (European Directory of Marine Organisations)."
      },
      {
        "@language": "ro",
        "@value": "Această proprietate leagă o organizație de identificatorul său EDMO (European Directory of Marine Organisations)."
      },
